{"seq":3,"slug":"communication-interface-drivers","title":"通信接口驱动开发","url":"/l-doc-books/h/hardware-electronics/embedded-bare-metal/peripheral-programming/communication-interface-drivers","wordCount":2062,"readingTime":9,"html":"<h1 id=\"通信接口驱动开发\">通信接口驱动开发</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>UART、SPI、I2C 是嵌入式系统中最主流的三条串行总线，选择与实现它们的驱动是外设编程的核心能力。三条主线贯穿本文：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>协议特征</strong>：异步/同步、全双工/半双工、信号线数与寻址方式，决定各接口的适用边界</li>\n<li><strong>速率与时钟</strong>：波特率生成（UART）、分频配置（SPI）、速度模式（I2C）共同决定实际吞吐</li>\n<li><strong>数据搬运</strong>：中断驱动与 DMA 模式决定 CPU 占用，环形缓冲区处理不定长数据</li>\n<li><strong>可靠性</strong>：ACK/NACK、时钟拉伸、总线卡死恢复等机制应对多设备共享总线时的异常</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"通信接口概览\">通信接口概览</h2><p>嵌入式系统中的通信接口是 MCU 与传感器、执行器、存储器和其他控制器之间交换数据的桥梁。三大主流串行接口——UART、SPI 和 I2C——各有其适用场景，理解其协议特征和驱动实现是外设编程的核心能力。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    MCU[MCU] --&gt;|全双工/点对点| UART[UART/USART]&#10;    MCU --&gt;|全双工/主从| SPI[SPI 总线]&#10;    MCU --&gt;|半双工/多从| I2C[I2C 总线]&#10;    UART --&gt; UART_DEV[GPS/蓝牙/调试串口]&#10;    SPI --&gt; SPI_DEV[Flash/LCD/高速传感器]&#10;    I2C --&gt; I2C_DEV[EEPROM/温湿度/IMU]\">graph LR\n    MCU[MCU] --&gt;|全双工/点对点| UART[UART/USART]\n    MCU --&gt;|全双工/主从| SPI[SPI 总线]\n    MCU --&gt;|半双工/多从| I2C[I2C 总线]\n    UART --&gt; UART_DEV[GPS/蓝牙/调试串口]\n    SPI --&gt; SPI_DEV[Flash/LCD/高速传感器]\n    I2C --&gt; I2C_DEV[EEPROM/温湿度/IMU]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>特性</th>\n<th>UART</th>\n<th>SPI</th>\n<th>I2C</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>信号线数</td>\n<td>2（TX/RX）</td>\n<td>4+（MOSI/MISO/SCK/CS）</td>\n<td>2（SDA/SCL）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>通信方式</td>\n<td>异步全双工</td>\n<td>同步全双工</td>\n<td>同步半双工</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>最大速率</td>\n<td>~4.5 Mbps</td>\n<td>~50 MHz+</td>\n<td>~3.4 Mbps（HS 模式）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>从设备数</td>\n<td>1 对 1</td>\n<td>每从 1 根 CS</td>\n<td>多达 127 个地址</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>时钟源</td>\n<td>双方独立波特率</td>\n<td>主机提供</td>\n<td>主机提供</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>硬件复杂度</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>高（仲裁/应答）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>典型用途</td>\n<td>调试、GPS、蓝牙</td>\n<td>Flash、显示屏</td>\n<td>传感器、EEPROM</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"uart-驱动开发\">UART 驱动开发</h2><h3 id=\"协议帧格式\">协议帧格式</h3><p>UART（通用异步收发器）以帧为单位传输数据，每帧包含起始位、数据位、可选校验位和停止位：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>帧结构</mtext><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mtext>Start</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo><mo>+</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mtext>Data</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>8</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>9</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo><mo>+</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mtext>Parity</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo><mo>+</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mtext>Stop</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{帧结构} = [\\text{Start}(1)] + [\\text{Data}(8/9)] + [\\text{Parity}(0/1)] + [\\text{Stop}(1/2)]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">帧结构</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Start</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">)]</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Data</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">8/9</span><span class=\"mclose\">)]</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Parity</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">0/1</span><span class=\"mclose\">)]</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Stop</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1/2</span><span class=\"mclose\">)]</span></span></span></span></span></div><div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>有效带宽</mtext><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mtext>数据位数</mtext><mtext>总帧位数</mtext></mfrac><mo>×</mo><mtext>波特率</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{有效带宽} = \\frac{\\text{数据位数}}{\\text{总帧位数}} \\times \\text{波特率}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">有效带宽</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0463em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">总帧位数</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">数据位数</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">波特率</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>以 115200 baud、8N1 配置（8 数据位、无校验、1 停止位）为例：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>有效速率</mtext><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>8</mn><mn>10</mn></mfrac><mo>×</mo><mn>115200</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>92160</mn><mtext> bps</mtext><mo>≈</mo><mn>11.25</mn><mtext> KB/s</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{有效速率} = \\frac{8}{10} \\times 115200 = 92160 \\text{ bps} \\approx 11.25 \\text{ KB/s}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">有效速率</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0074em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3214em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">10</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">8</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">115200</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">92160</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\"> bps</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">11.25</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\"> KB/s</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><h3 id=\"波特率生成\">波特率生成</h3><p>USART 的波特率由时钟分频器决定：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>BRR</mtext><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msub><mi>f</mi><mtext>PCLK</mtext></msub><mrow><mtext>Baudrate</mtext><mo>×</mo><mtext>过采样率</mtext></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{BRR} = \\frac{f_{\\text{PCLK}}}{\\text{Baudrate} \\times \\text{过采样率}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">BRR</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.1408em;vertical-align:-0.7693em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3714em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Baudrate</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">过采样率</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1076em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">PCLK</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7693em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>过采样率可选 16 倍（默认，容错性好）或 8 倍（支持更高波特率但噪声容忍度下降）。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>外设时钟</th>\n<th>目标波特率</th>\n<th>BRR 值</th>\n<th>实际波特率</th>\n<th>误差</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>84 MHz</td>\n<td>9600</td>\n<td>546.875</td>\n<td>9600</td>\n<td>0%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>84 MHz</td>\n<td>115200</td>\n<td>45.5625</td>\n<td>115108</td>\n<td>0.08%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>84 MHz</td>\n<td>921600</td>\n<td>5.6953</td>\n<td>923076</td>\n<td>0.16%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>42 MHz</td>\n<td>115200</td>\n<td>22.8125</td>\n<td>115068</td>\n<td>0.11%</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>波特率误差应控制在 ±2% 以内，超过此范围可能导致帧同步失败。</p>\n<h3 id=\"中断驱动收发\">中断驱动收发</h3><p>中断驱动模式平衡了 CPU 利用率和实时性：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>RXNE 中断</strong>：接收寄存器非空时触发，逐字节读取到环形缓冲区</li>\n<li><strong>TXE 中断</strong>：发送寄存器空时触发，从发送缓冲区取数据写入</li>\n<li><strong>IDLE 中断</strong>：检测到总线空闲（一帧时间无数据），标记接收完成</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>环形缓冲区</mtext><mo>=</mo><mtext>数组</mtext><mo>+</mo><mtext>写指针</mtext><mo>+</mo><mtext>读指针</mtext><mo>+</mo><mtext>长度</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{环形缓冲区} = \\text{数组} + \\text{写指针} + \\text{读指针} + \\text{长度}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">环形缓冲区</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">数组</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">写指针</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">读指针</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">长度</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><h3 id=\"dma-模式\">DMA 模式</h3><p>大数据量传输使用 DMA 避免逐字节中断开销：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>DMA 发送：内存缓冲区</mtext><mover><mo stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"3.0em\">→</mo><mpadded width=\"+0.6em\" lspace=\"0.3em\"><mtext>DMA</mtext></mpadded></mover><mtext>USART_DR</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{DMA 发送}：\\text{内存缓冲区} \\xrightarrow{\\text{DMA}} \\text{USART\\_DR}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1113em;vertical-align:-0.011em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">DMA </span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">发送</span></span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">：</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">内存缓冲区</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel x-arrow\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.1003em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.322em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight x-arrow-pad\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">DMA</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-2.689em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"hide-tail\" style=\"height:0.522em;min-width:1.469em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"0.522em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 522\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMaxYMin slice\"><path d=\"M0 241v40h399891c-47.3 35.3-84 78-110 128\n-16.7 32-27.7 63.7-33 95 0 1.3-.2 2.7-.5 4-.3 1.3-.5 2.3-.5 3 0 7.3 6.7 11 20\n 11 8 0 13.2-.8 15.5-2.5 2.3-1.7 4.2-5.5 5.5-11.5 2-13.3 5.7-27 11-41 14.7-44.7\n 39-84.5 73-119.5s73.7-60.2 119-75.5c6-2 9-5.7 9-11s-3-9-9-11c-45.3-15.3-85\n-40.5-119-75.5s-58.3-74.8-73-119.5c-4.7-14-8.3-27.3-11-40-1.3-6.7-3.2-10.8-5.5\n-12.5-2.3-1.7-7.5-2.5-15.5-2.5-14 0-21 3.7-21 11 0 2 2 10.3 6 25 20.7 83.3 67\n 151.7 139 205zm0 0v40h399900v-40z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.011em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9933em;vertical-align:-0.31em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">USART_DR</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p> </p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>DMA 接收：USART_DR</mtext><mover><mo stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"3.0em\">→</mo><mpadded width=\"+0.6em\" lspace=\"0.3em\"><mtext>DMA</mtext></mpadded></mover><mtext>内存缓冲区</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{DMA 接收}：\\text{USART\\_DR} \\xrightarrow{\\text{DMA}} \\text{内存缓冲区}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.4103em;vertical-align:-0.31em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">DMA </span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">接收</span></span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">：</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">USART_DR</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel x-arrow\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.1003em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.322em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight x-arrow-pad\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">DMA</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-2.689em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"hide-tail\" style=\"height:0.522em;min-width:1.469em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"0.522em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 522\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMaxYMin slice\"><path d=\"M0 241v40h399891c-47.3 35.3-84 78-110 128\n-16.7 32-27.7 63.7-33 95 0 1.3-.2 2.7-.5 4-.3 1.3-.5 2.3-.5 3 0 7.3 6.7 11 20\n 11 8 0 13.2-.8 15.5-2.5 2.3-1.7 4.2-5.5 5.5-11.5 2-13.3 5.7-27 11-41 14.7-44.7\n 39-84.5 73-119.5s73.7-60.2 119-75.5c6-2 9-5.7 9-11s-3-9-9-11c-45.3-15.3-85\n-40.5-119-75.5s-58.3-74.8-73-119.5c-4.7-14-8.3-27.3-11-40-1.3-6.7-3.2-10.8-5.5\n-12.5-2.3-1.7-7.5-2.5-15.5-2.5-14 0-21 3.7-21 11 0 2 2 10.3 6 25 20.7 83.3 67\n 151.7 139 205zm0 0v40h399900v-40z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.011em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">内存缓冲区</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>DMA 传输完成中断结合 IDLE 中断实现不定长数据接收的最优方案。</p>\n<h2 id=\"spi-驱动开发\">SPI 驱动开发</h2><h3 id=\"总线时序\">总线时序</h3><p>SPI（串行外设接口）是一种同步全双工协议，每个时钟周期主从双方各交换 1 位数据：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"sequenceDiagram\" data-source=\"sequenceDiagram&#10;    participant M as 主机 Master&#10;    participant S as 从机 Slave&#10;&#10;    M-&gt;&gt;S: 拉低 CS(片选从机)&#10;    loop 每个字节(8 个时钟周期)&#10;        M-&gt;&gt;S: SCK 时钟 + MOSI 数据位&#10;        S--&gt;&gt;M: MISO 数据位&#10;    end&#10;    M-&gt;&gt;S: 释放 CS(结束通信)\">sequenceDiagram\n    participant M as 主机 Master\n    participant S as 从机 Slave\n\n    M-&gt;&gt;S: 拉低 CS(片选从机)\n    loop 每个字节(8 个时钟周期)\n        M-&gt;&gt;S: SCK 时钟 + MOSI 数据位\n        S--&gt;&gt;M: MISO 数据位\n    end\n    M-&gt;&gt;S: 释放 CS(结束通信)</pre><h3 id=\"时钟极性与相位\">时钟极性与相位</h3><p>SPI 的 4 种工作模式由 CPOL（时钟极性）和 CPHA（时钟相位）组合定义：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>模式</th>\n<th>CPOL</th>\n<th>CPHA</th>\n<th>空闲时 SCK 电平</th>\n<th>数据采样沿</th>\n<th>数据切换沿</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Mode 0</td>\n<td>0</td>\n<td>0</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>上升沿</td>\n<td>下降沿</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Mode 1</td>\n<td>0</td>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>下降沿</td>\n<td>上升沿</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Mode 2</td>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>0</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>下降沿</td>\n<td>上升沿</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Mode 3</td>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>上升沿</td>\n<td>下降沿</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>从设备的数据手册会指定支持的 SPI 模式，主机必须匹配配置。SD 卡使用 Mode 0，多数传感器支持 Mode 0 和 Mode 3。</p>\n<h3 id=\"波特率配置\">波特率配置</h3><p>SPI 时钟频率通过分频器控制：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>f</mi><mtext>SCK</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msub><mi>f</mi><mtext>PCLK</mtext></msub><msup><mn>2</mn><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></mfrac><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>7</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f_{\\text{SCK}} = \\frac{f_{\\text{PCLK}}}{2^{n+1}} \\quad (n = 0,1,...,7)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1076em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">SCK</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0574em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3714em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7401em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.989em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">+</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1076em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">PCLK</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">...</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">7</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>分频系数</th>\n<th>PCLK=84 MHz 时的 SCK</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>/2</td>\n<td>42 MHz</td>\n<td>高速 Flash</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>/4</td>\n<td>21 MHz</td>\n<td>LCD 显示屏</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>/16</td>\n<td>5.25 MHz</td>\n<td>通用传感器</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>/256</td>\n<td>328 kHz</td>\n<td>低速设备</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"多从机管理\">多从机管理</h3><p>硬件 NSS 管脚仅支持单从机场景，多从机需使用 GPIO 手动管理片选：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>选中从机 </mtext><mi>i</mi><mo>⇔</mo><msub><mtext>CS</mtext><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"/><msub><mtext>其余 CS</mtext><mi>j</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>j</mi><mo mathvariant=\"normal\">≠</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{选中从机 }i \\Leftrightarrow \\text{CS}_i = 0, \\quad \\text{其余 CS}_j = 1 \\quad (j \\neq i)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">选中从机</span><span class=\"mord\"> </span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">⇔</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">CS</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">其余</span><span class=\"mord\"> CS</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\"><span class=\"mrel\"><span class=\"mord vbox\"><span class=\"thinbox\"><span class=\"rlap\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"inner\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mrel\"></span></span></span><span class=\"fix\"></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace nobreak\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>菊花链（Daisy-chain）模式下所有从机共享 CS，MISO/MOSI 级联，一次传输的数据长度等于所有从机移位寄存器的总长度。</p>\n<h2 id=\"i2c-驱动开发\">I2C 驱动开发</h2><h3 id=\"协议架构\">协议架构</h3><p>I2C（Inter-Integrated Circuit）是一种两线制多主多从总线协议，使用开漏驱动（线与逻辑）：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>SCL（串行时钟线）</strong>：主机驱动，所有设备可拉低实现时钟拉伸</li>\n<li><strong>SDA（串行数据线）</strong>：双向数据线，通过开漏+外部上拉实现多设备共享</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"寻址与传输格式\">寻址与传输格式</h3><p>I2C 使用 7 位或 10 位设备地址（7 位地址 + 1 位读写方向位）：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>地址字节</mtext><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mtext>A6:A0</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mtext>R/W</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{地址字节} = [\\text{A6:A0}][\\text{R/W}]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">地址字节</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">A6:A0</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">R/W</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span></span></div><div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>W</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\">‾</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">{</mo><mtable rowspacing=\"0.36em\" columnalign=\"left left\" columnspacing=\"1em\"><mtr><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mn>0</mn></mstyle></mtd><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mtext>主机写入从机</mtext></mstyle></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mn>1</mn></mstyle></mtd><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mtext>主机从从机读取</mtext></mstyle></mtd></mtr></mtable></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R/\\overline{W} = \\begin{cases} 0 &amp; \\text{主机写入从机} \\\\ 1 &amp; \\text{主机从从机读取} \\end{cases}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1333em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord overline\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8833em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.8033em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"overline-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:3em;vertical-align:-1.25em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size4\">{</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mtable\"><span class=\"col-align-l\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.69em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.69em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.008em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.25em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.008em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.19em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:1em;\"></span><span class=\"col-align-l\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.69em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.69em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.008em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">主机写入从机</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.25em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.008em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">主机从从机读取</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.19em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>完整传输序列：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>阶段</th>\n<th>动作</th>\n<th>SDA</th>\n<th>SCL</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>起始条件</td>\n<td>START</td>\n<td>SCL 高时 SDA 下降沿</td>\n<td>高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>地址+方向</td>\n<td>发送 8 位</td>\n<td>逐位输出</td>\n<td>时钟脉冲</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>应答位</td>\n<td>ACK/NACK</td>\n<td>从机拉低=ACK</td>\n<td>第 9 个脉冲</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>数据传输</td>\n<td>逐字节</td>\n<td>MSB 先</td>\n<td>每位一个脉冲</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>停止条件</td>\n<td>STOP</td>\n<td>SCL 高时 SDA 上升沿</td>\n<td>高</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"时钟拉伸\">时钟拉伸</h3><p>从设备可在 SCL 低电平期间将其保持为低（Clock Stretching），迫使主机等待直到从机释放 SCL：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>主机发送一个字节后</mtext><mo>→</mo><mtext>从机拉低 SCL 处理数据</mtext><mo>→</mo><mtext>释放 SCL 后发送 ACK</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{主机发送一个字节后} \\rightarrow \\text{从机拉低 SCL 处理数据} \\rightarrow \\text{释放 SCL 后发送 ACK}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">主机发送一个字节后</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">从机拉低</span><span class=\"mord\"> SCL </span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">处理数据</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">释放</span><span class=\"mord\"> SCL </span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">后发送</span><span class=\"mord\"> ACK</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>这一机制使低速从机能与高速主机协同工作，但可能引入不可预测的延迟。某些 I2C 主机控制器不支持时钟拉伸，需在选型时注意。</p>\n<h3 id=\"速度模式\">速度模式</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>I2C 模式</th>\n<th>最大速率</th>\n<th>SCL 上升时间要求</th>\n<th>应用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Standard Mode</td>\n<td>100 kbps</td>\n<td>≤1000 ns</td>\n<td>通用传感器</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Fast Mode</td>\n<td>400 kbps</td>\n<td>≤300 ns</td>\n<td>较快外设</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Fast Mode Plus</td>\n<td>1 Mbps</td>\n<td>≤120 ns</td>\n<td>高速 EEPROM</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>High Speed</td>\n<td>3.4 Mbps</td>\n<td>≤40 ns</td>\n<td>高带宽传感器</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"错误处理\">错误处理</h3><p>I2C 通信中常见的错误类型和处理策略：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>错误类型</th>\n<th>原因</th>\n<th>检测方法</th>\n<th>恢复策略</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>NACK</td>\n<td>从机未响应/忙碌</td>\n<td>ACK 位检查</td>\n<td>重试或报错</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>总线忙</td>\n<td>BUSY 标志持续</td>\n<td>超时检测</td>\n<td>发送 9 个 SCL + STOP</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>仲裁丢失</td>\n<td>多主冲突</td>\n<td>AF 标志</td>\n<td>等待总线空闲后重试</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>总线错误</td>\n<td>时序违规</td>\n<td>BERR 标志</td>\n<td>软件复位 I2C 外设</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>总线卡死（SDA 被从机拉低不释放）的恢复方法：用 GPIO 模式手动生成至少 9 个 SCL 时钟脉冲，迫使从机释放 SDA，然后发送 STOP 条件重建总线。</p>\n<h2 id=\"通信协议选型决策\">通信协议选型决策</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    START[通信需求] --&gt; Q1{需要多少信号线?}&#10;    Q1 --&gt;|越少越好| I2C_PATH[I2C: 2 线]&#10;    Q1 --&gt;|不在意| Q2{传输速率要求?}&#10;    Q2 --&gt;|&gt;10 Mbps| SPI_PATH[SPI: 高速]&#10;    Q2 --&gt;|&lt;1 Mbps| Q3{需要异步?}&#10;    Q3 --&gt;|是| UART_PATH[UART: 异步]&#10;    Q3 --&gt;|否| Q4{多从设备?}&#10;    Q4 --&gt;|&gt;4 个| I2C_PATH&#10;    Q4 --&gt;|≤4 个| SPI_PATH\">flowchart TD\n    START[通信需求] --&gt; Q1{需要多少信号线?}\n    Q1 --&gt;|越少越好| I2C_PATH[I2C: 2 线]\n    Q1 --&gt;|不在意| Q2{传输速率要求?}\n    Q2 --&gt;|&gt;10 Mbps| SPI_PATH[SPI: 高速]\n    Q2 --&gt;|&lt;1 Mbps| Q3{需要异步?}\n    Q3 --&gt;|是| UART_PATH[UART: 异步]\n    Q3 --&gt;|否| Q4{多从设备?}\n    Q4 --&gt;|&gt;4 个| I2C_PATH\n    Q4 --&gt;|≤4 个| SPI_PATH</pre><p>综合选型考量：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>布线约束强</strong>（线数少）→ I2C（2 线连多个传感器）</li>\n<li><strong>速度优先</strong>（Flash 读写/LCD 刷屏）→ SPI（几十 MHz 时钟）</li>\n<li><strong>长距离/跨板</strong>（&gt;1 m）→ UART + RS-485 电平转换</li>\n<li><strong>调试输出</strong>（printf 重定向）→ UART（最简单最常用）</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>接口特征</strong>：UART 异步全双工点对点、SPI 同步全双工且速率最高、I2C 两线多从且布线最省，三者分别适配调试/高速/多传感器场景。</li>\n<li><strong>速率配置</strong>：UART 靠 BRR 分频生成波特率（误差须控制在 ±2% 内），SPI 用 2 的幂次分频，I2C 分 Standard/Fast/Fast+/HS 四档速度模式。</li>\n<li><strong>数据搬运</strong>：中断模式（RXNE/TXE/IDLE）配环形缓冲区平衡实时性与 CPU，大数据量改用 DMA，配合 IDLE 中断接收不定长数据。</li>\n<li><strong>时序匹配</strong>：SPI 主机必须匹配从机的 CPOL/CPHA 模式；多从机需用 GPIO 手动管理片选或采用菊花链。</li>\n<li><strong>可靠性</strong>：I2C 用 ACK/NACK、时钟拉伸与总线忙检测处理异常，SDA 卡死时可用 GPIO 手动发 9 个 SCL 脉冲并送 STOP 恢复总线。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"通信接口驱动开发","id":"通信接口驱动开发"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"通信接口概览","id":"通信接口概览"},{"level":2,"text":"UART 驱动开发","id":"uart-驱动开发"},{"level":3,"text":"协议帧格式","id":"协议帧格式"},{"level":3,"text":"波特率生成","id":"波特率生成"},{"level":3,"text":"中断驱动收发","id":"中断驱动收发"},{"level":3,"text":"DMA 模式","id":"dma-模式"},{"level":2,"text":"SPI 驱动开发","id":"spi-驱动开发"},{"level":3,"text":"总线时序","id":"总线时序"},{"level":3,"text":"时钟极性与相位","id":"时钟极性与相位"},{"level":3,"text":"波特率配置","id":"波特率配置"},{"level":3,"text":"多从机管理","id":"多从机管理"},{"level":2,"text":"I2C 驱动开发","id":"i2c-驱动开发"},{"level":3,"text":"协议架构","id":"协议架构"},{"level":3,"text":"寻址与传输格式","id":"寻址与传输格式"},{"level":3,"text":"时钟拉伸","id":"时钟拉伸"},{"level":3,"text":"速度模式","id":"速度模式"},{"level":3,"text":"错误处理","id":"错误处理"},{"level":2,"text":"通信协议选型决策","id":"通信协议选型决策"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"定时器、PWM 与 ADC","url":"/l-doc-books/h/hardware-electronics/embedded-bare-metal/peripheral-programming/timer-pwm-adc"},"next":{"title":"RTOS 调度原理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/hardware-electronics/embedded-bare-metal/rtos-basics/rtos-scheduling-principles"}}